  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The planned main product/s and/or service/s of the Activity (Outputs) is/are: Strengthening ASEANstats participants&#x2019; knowledge of NADABAS. 

The expected effect/s for the target group of the Activity (Outcome) is/are: Improving the quality of national accounts in ASEAN member states.

The Activity supports SDGs targets 17.18 and 17.19 related to enhancing capacity building support to developing countries.</narrative>
  </description>
