  <tag code="17.18" vocabulary="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">17.18 - By 2020, enhance capacity-building support to developing countries, including for least developed countries and small island developing States, to increase significantly the availability of high-quality, timely and reliable data disaggregated by income, gender, age, race, ethnicity, migratory status, disability, geographic location and other characteristics relevant in national contexts</narrative>
  </tag>
  <tag code="17.19" vocabulary="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">17.19 - By 2030, build on existing initiatives to develop measurements of progress on sustainable development that complement gross domestic product, and support statistical capacity-building in developing countries</narrative>
  </tag>
